The Associate of Science (AS) degree in Science – Major in Chemistry is designed to prepare students for university transfer in the field. The Career Studies Certificate (CSC) in Pre-pharmacy Science is designed to provide access to additional, necessary pre-pharmacy coursework.

**Program Chair**: Sandy Davis • [sdavis@vhcc.edu](mailto:sdavis@vhcc.edu) • 276-739-2464

